Package: gifter
Type: Package
Title: Genome-Inferred Functional Traits Between Molecular Anchors
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Antton", "Alberdi", email = "antton.alberdi@sund.ku.dk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Infers whether a genome encodes a biologically defined enzymatic
    capability between curated molecular anchors. Traits are evaluated through
    explicit marker, component, enzyme-system, reaction, route, and trait logic
    stored in a versioned SQLite reference database. The package reports both
    complete and closest incomplete routes together with auditable genomic
    evidence.
